#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-manual-tuning.rst:5
#: 5ed966dfe302433fad8b6a5c55b8d40b
msgid "Manual Tuning Instructions"
msgstr "手动调参说明"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-manual-tuning.rst:8
#: c7999bc44cae4274a2afe4d5dd7db9d7
msgid "Pitch and Roll Axes"
msgstr "俯仰和横滚轴"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-manual-tuning.rst:10
#: b3b60a3bc32e439cbd1d1a904cfc1fff
msgid ""
"Setting ``ATC_RAT_xxx_FF`` and ``ATC_ACCEL_x_MAX`` Parameters for Desired "
"Pitch and Roll Response"
msgstr "为期望的俯仰和横滚响应设置 ``ATC_RAT_xxx_FF`` 和 ``ATC_ACCEL_x_MAX`` 参数"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-manual-tuning.rst:12
#: e77ca6f299d54cf38d494e4967825058
msgid ""
"In both pitch and roll axes, the ``ATC_RAT_xxx_FF`` gain is set so that the "
"actual aircraft rate matches the desired rate. To do this, the RATE message "
"in the log is required to compare the RATE.PDes and RATE.P log data for "
"pitch and the RATE.RDes and RATE.R log data for roll."
msgstr ""
"在俯仰和横滚轴上，设置 ``ATC_RAT_xxx_FF`` 增益，使飞行器的实际速率与期望速率匹配。为此，需要使用日志中的 RATE 消息，比较俯仰的"
" RATE.PDes 和 RATE.P 日志数据，以及横滚的 RATE.RDes 和 RATE.R 日志数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-manual-tuning.rst:17
#: 411e825b42ca47498802535adb9089a6
msgid ""
"With the ``ATC_RAT_xxx_FF`` gains set to 0.15, takeoff and establish a hover"
" in Stabilize flight mode, then make some sharp stick inputs in both pitch "
"and roll. Land and pull the log from the microSD card and look at the "
"signals in a log reviewing software. If the actual rate is more than the "
"desired rate then you'll want to decrease ``ATC_RAT_xxx_FF``. If it is less,"
" increase ``ATC_RAT_xxx_FF``."
msgstr ""
"将 ``ATC_RAT_xxx_FF`` 增益设为 0.15，起飞并在 Stabilize "
"飞行模式下建立悬停，然后在俯仰和横滚方向进行一些急促的摇杆输入。降落并从 microSD "
"卡中调取日志，用日志查看软件查看信号。如果实际速率大于期望速率，则降低 ``ATC_RAT_xxx_FF``。如果小于，则增加 "
"``ATC_RAT_xxx_FF``。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-manual-tuning.rst:23
#: d4d58fb416ee4e4ba1f2eddcd092edd4
msgid "**(to be added...FF calculation directly from log data)**"
msgstr "**(待添加……从日志数据直接计算 FF)**"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-manual-tuning.rst:25
#: d4e467f4be0748b9ae9e810f0f5ffba3
msgid ""
"If the desired and actual rates are offset by some amount, it means that "
"your swash was not properly leveled in the setup. In this case, just make "
"sure the change in rate is similar in amplitude between desired and actual."
"  If you get the rates to match and they feel like they are too fast, then "
"reduce the ``ATC_ACCEL_x_MAX`` parameter and repeat the process above to "
"match the desired and actual rates."
msgstr ""
"如果期望速率和实际速率存在一定偏差，说明您的斜盘在设置时没有正确调平。在这种情况下，只需确保速率的变化幅度在期望值和实际值之间相似即可。如果速率匹配但感觉太快，则降低"
" ``ATC_ACCEL_x_MAX`` 参数，并重复上述过程以匹配期望速率和实际速率。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-manual-tuning.rst:31
#: 5e0ca6dd1f1d481fbe072c4314e1a21e
msgid ""
"If while tuning the ``ATC_RAT_xxx_FF`` gain the aircraft starts to "
"oscillate, reduce the ``ATC_ANG_xxx_P`` gain for that axis until the "
"oscillations stop.  However for most helicopters the suggested values above "
"should not cause this problem."
msgstr ""
"如果在调参 ``ATC_RAT_xxx_FF`` 增益时飞行器开始振荡，则降低该轴的 ``ATC_ANG_xxx_P`` "
"增益，直到振荡停止。但对于大多数直升机，上述建议值不应导致此问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-manual-tuning.rst:36
#: 541b069b4a29444f85fc515d9d122504
msgid "Tuning the ``ATC_RAT_xxx_D`` and ``ATC_RAT_xxx_P`` gain"
msgstr "调参 ``ATC_RAT_xxx_D`` 和 ``ATC_RAT_xxx_P`` 增益"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-manual-tuning.rst:38
#: 4b978c6b80b14f78b26b1dba188773eb
msgid ""
"Once you have the heli responding nicely with the ``ATC_RAT_xxx_FF`` gain, "
"now tune the PID gains. The rate PID controller provides stability to reject"
" disturbances and keep the actual aircraft following the software demanded "
"rates."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``ATC_RAT_xxx_FF`` 增益使直升机获得良好响应后，现在调参 PID 增益。速率 PID "
"控制器提供稳定性以抑制扰动，并保持实际飞行器跟随软件要求的速率。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-manual-tuning.rst:42
#: 318f768b88314ef0989df3e56f66ad24
msgid ""
"Start with the ``ATC_RAT_xxx_D`` gain.  Use the :ref:`Transmitter based "
"tuning<common-transmitter-tuning>` feature of ArduCopter. Make the following"
" parameter changes:"
msgstr ""
"从 ``ATC_RAT_xxx_D`` 增益开始。使用 ArduCopter 的 :ref:`发射机调参功能<common-transmitter-"
"tuning>`。进行以下参数更改："

