#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-manual-tuning.rst:55
#: 4bad62e1b3d24cc5a801d177980ea505
msgid ""
"Adjust the tuning knob until the "
":ref:`ATC_RAT_RLL_D<ATC_RAT_RLL_D__AC_AttitudeControl_Heli>` and "
":ref:`ATC_RAT_PIT_D<ATC_RAT_PIT_D__AC_AttitudeControl_Heli>` gains are "
"0.001. Lift into a hover and make some sharp stick inputs in roll.  Most "
"helicopters will see roll oscillations before they see pitch oscillations. "
"That is why roll inputs are suggested.  If it doesn't shake, increase the "
"gain by 0.001 and try it again. At the value where you get rapid shaking, "
"cut that value in half and enter it as the final tuning value for "
":ref:`ATC_RAT_RLL_D<ATC_RAT_RLL_D__AC_AttitudeControl_Heli>` and "
":ref:`ATC_RAT_PIT_D<ATC_RAT_PIT_D__AC_AttitudeControl_Heli>`.  Test hover "
"the heli and make some rapid stick movements in both pitch and roll to make "
"sure it's stable."
msgstr ""
"调整调参旋钮，直到 :ref:`ATC_RAT_RLL_D<ATC_RAT_RLL_D__AC_AttitudeControl_Heli>` 和 "
":ref:`ATC_RAT_PIT_D<ATC_RAT_PIT_D__AC_AttitudeControl_Heli>` 增益为 "
"0.001。起飞悬停并在横滚方向进行一些急促的摇杆输入。大多数直升机在横滚方向会比俯仰方向更早出现振荡。这就是建议进行横滚输入的原因。如果不抖动，将增益增加"
" 0.001 后再试。在开始出现快速抖动的值处，将该值减半并作为 "
":ref:`ATC_RAT_RLL_D<ATC_RAT_RLL_D__AC_AttitudeControl_Heli>` 和 "
":ref:`ATC_RAT_PIT_D<ATC_RAT_PIT_D__AC_AttitudeControl_Heli>` "
"的最终调参值。悬停测试直升机并在俯仰和横滚方向进行一些快速摇杆动作，确保稳定。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-manual-tuning.rst:64
#: 956d124871c3494fac65b6d6cb9d0058
msgid ""
"Now tune the ``ATC_RAT_xxx_P`` gains.  Make the following tuning parameter "
"changes:"
msgstr "现在调参 ``ATC_RAT_xxx_P`` 增益。进行以下调参参数更改："

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-manual-tuning.rst:67
#: ce6bd93db20d4ce9a0dcc2838c0026fa
msgid "4"
msgstr "4"

