msgid "0.3*"
msgstr "0.3*"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-manual-tuning.rst:74
#: 1a018db1b97043fabd295f5eed335959
msgid "*for futaba radios this equates to one increment in the knob to 0.01*"
msgstr "*对于 futaba 遥控器，这相当于旋钮每增加一档对应 0.01*"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-manual-tuning.rst:76
#: 201257c21c954a9993c5ee1be002aa3b
msgid ""
"Adjust the tuning knob until the "
":ref:`ATC_RAT_RLL_P<ATC_RAT_RLL_P__AC_AttitudeControl_Heli>` and "
":ref:`ATC_RAT_PIT_P<ATC_RAT_PIT_P__AC_AttitudeControl_Heli>`  gains are "
"0.05. Lift into a hover and roll aggressively from side to side.  If it "
"doesn't shake, increase the gain by 0.01 and try it again. At the value "
"where you get rapid shaking, cut that value in half and enter it as the "
"final tuning value for "
":ref:`ATC_RAT_RLL_P<ATC_RAT_RLL_P__AC_AttitudeControl_Heli>` and "
":ref:`ATC_RAT_PIT_P<ATC_RAT_PIT_P__AC_AttitudeControl_Heli>`. Test hover the"
" heli and make some rapid stick movements in both pitch and roll to make "
"sure it's stable."
msgstr ""
"调整调参旋钮，直到 :ref:`ATC_RAT_RLL_P<ATC_RAT_RLL_P__AC_AttitudeControl_Heli>` 和 "
":ref:`ATC_RAT_PIT_P<ATC_RAT_PIT_P__AC_AttitudeControl_Heli>` 增益为 "
"0.05。起飞悬停并在左右横滚方向进行激进的操控。如果不抖动，将增益增加 0.01 后再试。在开始出现快速抖动的值处，将该值减半并作为 "
":ref:`ATC_RAT_RLL_P<ATC_RAT_RLL_P__AC_AttitudeControl_Heli>` 和 "
":ref:`ATC_RAT_PIT_P<ATC_RAT_PIT_P__AC_AttitudeControl_Heli>` "
"的最终调参值。悬停测试直升机并在俯仰和横滚方向进行一些快速摇杆动作，确保稳定。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-manual-tuning.rst:83
#: 3ecdad3f983e4e29a03457d61c5f7cc7
msgid ""
"After tuning the ``ATC_RAT_xxx_D`` and ``ATC_RAT_xxx_P`` gains the aircraft "
"should feel much smoother. Tune quality can be also checked by viewing the "
"ATT.DesP vs ATT.P and ATT.DesR vs ATT.R log plots:"
msgstr ""
"调参 ``ATC_RAT_xxx_D`` 和 ``ATC_RAT_xxx_P`` 增益后，飞行器应感觉更加平稳。调参质量也可以通过查看 ATT.DesP"
" vs ATT.P 和 ATT.DesR vs ATT.R 日志图来检验："

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-manual-tuning.rst:89
#: 00c4cb43c9f94dcd9390032b2c25735a
msgid ""
"Setting the :ref:`ATC_RAT_RLL_I<ATC_RAT_RLL_I__AC_AttitudeControl_Heli>` and"
" :ref:`ATC_RAT_PIT_I<ATC_RAT_PIT_I__AC_AttitudeControl_Heli>`"
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`ATC_RAT_RLL_I<ATC_RAT_RLL_I__AC_AttitudeControl_Heli>` 和 "
":ref:`ATC_RAT_PIT_I<ATC_RAT_PIT_I__AC_AttitudeControl_Heli>`"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-manual-tuning.rst:91
#: edd611e7b3f0463b90f6654b7e5a837c
msgid ""
"It is recommended to set the "
":ref:`ATC_RAT_PIT_I<ATC_RAT_PIT_I__AC_AttitudeControl_Heli>` gain equal to "
"the :ref:`ATC_RAT_PIT_FF<ATC_RAT_PIT_FF__AC_AttitudeControl_Heli>` gain and "
"the :ref:`ATC_RAT_RLL_I<ATC_RAT_RLL_I__AC_AttitudeControl_Heli>` gain equal "
"to the :ref:`ATC_RAT_RLL_FF<ATC_RAT_RLL_FF__AC_AttitudeControl_Heli>` gain."
msgstr ""
"建议将 :ref:`ATC_RAT_PIT_I<ATC_RAT_PIT_I__AC_AttitudeControl_Heli>` 增益设置为等于 "
":ref:`ATC_RAT_PIT_FF<ATC_RAT_PIT_FF__AC_AttitudeControl_Heli>` 增益，将 "
":ref:`ATC_RAT_RLL_I<ATC_RAT_RLL_I__AC_AttitudeControl_Heli>` 增益设置为等于 "
":ref:`ATC_RAT_RLL_FF<ATC_RAT_RLL_FF__AC_AttitudeControl_Heli>` 增益。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-manual-tuning.rst:94
#: 4567987d751d4bd9bd1f75c1710730cf
msgid "Yaw Axis"
msgstr "偏航轴"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-manual-tuning.rst:97
#: 9b70dce0dd4146ae8b9ebdf4cb0b7fd3
msgid "Setting :ref:`ATC_RAT_YAW_FF<ATC_RAT_YAW_FF__AC_AttitudeControl_Heli>`"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`ATC_RAT_YAW_FF<ATC_RAT_YAW_FF__AC_AttitudeControl_Heli>`"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-manual-tuning.rst:99
#: 63dbfda7b1df44279d0dbb689c07a003
msgid ""
"In most cases, the feedforward required for the yaw axis could be very small"
" or even zero.  To check the feedforward required, hover the helicopter and "
"perform a constant rate 90 deg turn.  Pull the log data and look at the "
"RATE.Yout signal.  Determine the average RATE.Yout during the time the yaw "
"rate (RATE.Y signal) was constant.  Feedforward gain is determined by "
"dividing the average RATE.Yout by the average RATE.Y in rad/s."
msgstr ""
"在大多数情况下，偏航轴所需的前馈可以非常小，甚至为零。要检查所需的前馈，悬停直升机并进行恒定速率的 90 度转弯。调取日志数据并查看 RATE.Yout"
" 信号。确定偏航速率（RATE.Y 信号）恒定期间的平均 RATE.Yout。前馈增益通过将平均 RATE.Yout 除以平均 "
"RATE.Y（rad/s）来确定。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-manual-tuning.rst:102
#: 3c5b87722959434094c43ad88c5a7a5b
msgid ""
"Tuning :ref:`ATC_RAT_YAW_D<ATC_RAT_YAW_D__AC_AttitudeControl_Heli>` and "
":ref:`ATC_RAT_YAW_P<ATC_RAT_YAW_P__AC_AttitudeControl_Heli>`"
msgstr ""
"调参 :ref:`ATC_RAT_YAW_D<ATC_RAT_YAW_D__AC_AttitudeControl_Heli>` 和 "
":ref:`ATC_RAT_YAW_P<ATC_RAT_YAW_P__AC_AttitudeControl_Heli>`"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-manual-tuning.rst:103
#: 7af5e27c5b504f7b85b84447702b166a
msgid ""
"Spool up the heli and hover it no more than .25 meters above ground in "
"Stabilize flight mode and test the starting tail settings. If the tail seems"
" \"loose\" and doesn't want to hold increase the "
":ref:`ATC_RAT_YAW_P<ATC_RAT_YAW_P__AC_AttitudeControl_Heli>`. If the tail "
"slowly wags back and forth, the "
":ref:`ATC_RAT_YAW_P<ATC_RAT_YAW_P__AC_AttitudeControl_Heli>` may be too "
"high. If the tail rapidly shakes side to side reduce the "
":ref:`ATC_ANG_YAW_P<ATC_ANG_YAW_P>`."
msgstr ""
"在 Stabilize 飞行模式下，在离地不超过 0.25 米处加速旋翼并悬停，测试初始尾翼设置。如果尾翼感觉\"松散\"且不愿保持，则增加 "
":ref:`ATC_RAT_YAW_P<ATC_RAT_YAW_P__AC_AttitudeControl_Heli>`。如果尾翼缓慢左右摇摆，则 "
":ref:`ATC_RAT_YAW_P<ATC_RAT_YAW_P__AC_AttitudeControl_Heli>` "
"可能过高。如果尾翼快速左右抖动，则降低 :ref:`ATC_ANG_YAW_P<ATC_ANG_YAW_P>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-manual-tuning.rst:108
#: eb93dfa4f33745c4a40bf91af9a54b59
msgid ""
"In all cases it is not recommended to adjust "
":ref:`ATC_ANG_YAW_P<ATC_ANG_YAW_P>` below 3.5 or "
":ref:`ATC_RAT_YAW_P<ATC_RAT_YAW_P__AC_AttitudeControl_Heli>` above 0.38. If "
"your helicopter cannot seem to achieve a solid tail within those limits you "
"likely have a mechanical problem with the tail - either excessive \"slop\" "
"or play in the linkage, binding of the linkage or a servo problem. Correct "
"the problem before proceeding with roll and pitch tuning."
msgstr ""
"在所有情况下，不建议将 :ref:`ATC_ANG_YAW_P<ATC_ANG_YAW_P>` 调低于 3.5 或将 "
":ref:`ATC_RAT_YAW_P<ATC_RAT_YAW_P__AC_AttitudeControl_Heli>` 调高于 "
"0.38。如果您的直升机在这些限制内似乎无法实现稳定的尾翼，则可能存在尾翼机械问题——连杆中过多的\"间隙\"或游隙、连杆卡滞或舵机问题。在继续横滚和俯仰调参之前纠正问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-manual-tuning.rst:114
#: 4d29671fd4c743f6ac77deb809280878
msgid ""
"The tune quality can be checked by examining the logs for ATT.DesYaw vs "
"ATT.Yaw as shown below for an imperfect but flyable tune:"
msgstr "调参质量可以通过检查 ATT.DesYaw vs ATT.Yaw 的日志来验证，如下所示，这是一个不完美但可飞行的调参："

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-manual-tuning.rst:119
#: 9cf16124ee874521b458e84396b7bf5b
msgid ""
"Note that there is a little overshoot and neutral ringing indicating that "
"the FF or P gain is a little high or there is not enough D and could be "
"improved a bit."
msgstr "注意有一些超调和中性震荡，表明 FF 或 P 增益略高，或 D 不足，还可以进一步改善。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-manual-tuning.rst:123
#: bbf1cf8052f54b70a4855482118f4c34
msgid "Tuning a Flybar Equipped Head"
msgstr "调参装有飞杆头的直升机"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-manual-tuning.rst:125
#: ac4af4a7cc404dec969e5d2ca351c4ae
msgid ""
"The setup of a helicopter with flybar equipped head does not require the "
"``H_FLYBAR_MODE`` set to flybar mode.  This parameter only affects the ACRO "
"flight mode.  Unless there is a reason passthrough provided by the flybar "
"setting in ACRO mode is needed, then it is recommended that "
"``H_FLYBAR_MODE`` is left at its default of no flybar.  If you choose to use"
" the flybar mode then the FF gain is set as described below.  Otherwise the "
"FF is tuned just like an flybarless head."
msgstr ""
"装有飞杆桨头的直升机在设置时不需要将 ``H_FLYBAR_MODE`` 设置为飞杆模式。此参数仅影响 ACRO 飞行模式。除非有理由需要 ACRO "
"模式下飞杆设置提供的直通功能，否则建议将 ``H_FLYBAR_MODE`` 保持为默认的无飞杆。如果选择使用飞杆模式，则按下文所述设置 FF "
"增益。否则，FF 的调参方式与无飞杆桨头完全相同。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-manual-tuning.rst:132
#: cb76eb85afad4becbc789cdf01c525a0
msgid ""
"For flybar heads, the flybar is a mechanical version of the rate PID loop. "
"So flybar is tuned using only FF in pitch and roll. The rate D and P gains "
"are left set to zero for flybar. I-gain, IMAX, and ILMI are tuned just like "
"FBL."
msgstr ""
"对于飞杆头，飞杆是速率 PID 回路的机械版本。因此飞杆仅使用俯仰和横滚的 FF 进行调参。速率 D 和 P 增益对飞杆保持为零。I 增益、IMAX 和"
" ILMI 的调参与无飞杆头（FBL）完全相同。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-manual-tuning.rst:134
#: d21dfd8da3eb45a7b72b243a6ffefe0c
msgid ""
"With a flybar head, where the linkage rate is normally lower, it is "
"recommended to start with 0.22 FF for both pitch and roll and you will "
"likely have to go higher with FF. But for a flybarless head, FF shouldn't be"
" more than 0.22 unless you have really really slow servos or slow linkage "
"rate. With all helicopters, the FF gain compensates for differences in servo"
" and linkage speed."
msgstr ""
"对于飞杆头，连杆速率通常较低，建议从 0.22 的 FF 开始（俯仰和横滚），您可能需要更高的 FF。但对于无飞杆头，FF 不应超过 "
"0.22，除非您的舵机速度非常慢或连杆速率非常慢。对于所有直升机，FF 增益补偿舵机和连杆速度的差异。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-manual-tuning.rst:141
#: dde866edcc5446b2827a521879c476bb
msgid ""
"Below is a plot of beginning a tune on a flybar helicopter using the "
"starting setting of "
":ref:`ATC_RAT_RLL_FF<ATC_RAT_RLL_FF__AC_AttitudeControl_Heli>` = 0.22. The "
"graph shows the aircraft's response to the rate request of the attitude "
"controller is low, meaning the FF value must be increased to achieve proper "
"rate response."
msgstr ""
"以下是以 :ref:`ATC_RAT_RLL_FF<ATC_RAT_RLL_FF__AC_AttitudeControl_Heli>` = 0.22 "
"的初始设置开始对飞杆直升机进行调参的图。图表显示飞行器对姿态控制器速率请求的响应较低，这意味着 FF 值必须增加以实现正确的速率响应。"
